<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Cornerstone Realty rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Cornerstone Realty rated buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interstate/Johnson Lane said analyst Kenneth Smith started coverage of Cornerstone Realty Income Trust Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1997 Q2 EPS of $0.26, Q3 $0.27 and Q4 $0.28.</p>
<p>-- gives the stock a 12-month price target of $12.</p>
<p>-- Company went public on April 18 at $10.50 a share.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed up 3/8 to 10-7/8 on the NYSE.</p>
</text>
